@host = http://localhost:5142

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Health (ready — includes S3)
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Items
GET {{host}}/api/v1/item/test

###
POST {{host}}/api/v1/item/test
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "test item"
}

### Files — list
GET {{host}}/api/v1/file/list

### Files — upload (replace the file path)
# POST {{host}}/api/v1/file/upload
# Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

### Files — download
# GET {{host}}/api/v1/file/download/{key}

### Files — delete
# DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/file/{key}
